From 9c950be01992b7eb6841b29ead7fdc5c9c610afe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:41:09 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add Model::count() and use it for enrollments and
 dashboard

Model::count(array $conditions = []) runs SELECT COUNT(*) with bound equality conditions and HasMany::count() delegates to it. Event::enrollmentsCount() no longer loads every enrollment, and the admin dashboard shows the total of events with Event::count().
